{"id":"54da139362531e67","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nspace.md","title":"Nondeterministic Space","display":"df-nspace — Nondeterministic Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"display":"df-nspace — Nondeterministic Space","label":"28-df-nspace","aliases":["28-df-nspace"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nspace — Nondeterministic Space"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nspace</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 是空间界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{space}_N(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{space}_N(x)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a> 中所有分支曾访问工作带格数的上确界，不计只读输入带。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(N)\">\\(L(N)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span> 采用本目录机器约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\n\\bigl(L=L(N)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n(\\operatorname{space}_N(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{time}_N(x)&lt;\\infty)\\bigr)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\n\\bigl(L=L(N)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n(\\operatorname{space}_N(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{time}_N(x)&lt;\\infty)\\bigr)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>擦掉工作带内容不会返还已访问空间；空白格也可能承载头位置和计算历史，不能按当前非空白格数计量。本目录采用全分支停机的空间机；在空间可构造且至少对数的界上，由配置计数器可得原书备注4.3中的等价性。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§4.1及备注4.3；印刷78–80页；PDF104–106页。已核对只读输入不计空间及停机变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 是空间界；$\\operatorname{space}_N(x)$ 是 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 中所有分支曾访问工作带格数的上确界，不计只读输入带。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{space}_N(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_N(x)","display":false},{"tex":"L(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\n\\bigl(L=L(N)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n(\\operatorname{space}_N(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{time}_N(x)<\\infty)\\bigr)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)$ 见 [[28-df-nspace]]，仅计工作带且允许常数因子。"},{"id":"e88b5b361423eb7a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE}(t)$ 是 [[28-df-nspace]] 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；$a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"资源函数：[[28-df-big-oh]]、[[28-df-time-constructible]]、[[28-df-space-constructible]]、[[28-df-dtime]]、[[28-df-ntime]]、[[28-df-dspace]]、[[28-df-nspace]]。"},{"id":"1db27c06cce0d3e2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-nspace]]。"},{"id":"58e742656f0db590","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e244e427679f34a1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e6357334ccd3589d","256220eba4eba968","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}